                "retweet_count": 524,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "In other words, Donald Trump\u2019s \u201cconcept of a plan\u201d for health care is another cynical attempt to repeal Obamacare.\n\nIt\u2019s the same failed Republican plan that\u2019s been rejected by voters and Congress.\n\nWe can lower costs and open the government TODAY by extending ACA tax credits.",
